From: Calogero Mandracchia <calogero@efebia.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:49:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] app-server: test the channel barrier

The fake channel server supports channel/fence: while fenced it refuses
new input, and a fence request emits its backlog, then the marker. The
tests hold input accepted before the fence, release it or deliver on
reopening what is not discarded, also when the server restarts while
closed, check that a retried reopening has no effect, keep user turns
working while closed, and check the errors.
